<title>LATVIA: EBRD to buy into Latvia's Riga Commercial Bank.</title>
<headline>EBRD to buy into Latvia's Riga Commercial Bank.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD) is planning to buy a stake in one of the leading banks in Latvia, Riga Commercial Bank, a bank spokesman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>He declined to say what size the stake would be but said that a signing ceremony would take place on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The EBRD already has stakes in leading Latvian bank Unibanka and in the smaller Zemes Bank.</p>
<p>Riga Commercial Bank made a 1995 profit of 465,000 lats versus a 1994 profit of 1.04 million lats. Plans are in progress to have its shares quoted on the stock exchange.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
